## Recommended Batch 11 (Opus-direct, 2 items, ~50-60K combined)

### Item 1: ContactLog UI (T2, ~25-30K)
First consumer of the contactLogListForCustomer + contactLogCreate procedures
from Batch 10. Goes onto the existing customer-detail page.

Files to touch:
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/customers/[id]/page.tsx — add
  a "Touchpoints" section below the existing customer summary. Server Component
  fetches the latest 20 contact logs via prisma directly (mirrors existing
  data-fetch pattern). Embed a <ContactLogTimeline /> Client Component for the
  list rendering + filter chips by type. Embed a <QuickAddContactLog /> Client
  Component for the inline create modal.
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/customers/[id]/contact-log-timeline.tsx
  — NEW Client Component, type filter chips, optimistic delete via trpc
  contactLogDelete useMutation, type-icon legend.
- apps/web/src/app/(tenant)/[slug]/(app)/crm/customers/[id]/quick-add-contact-log.tsx
  — NEW Client Component, dialog (shadcn/ui dialog already imported elsewhere),
  type picker + subject + body + occurredAt date input, calls trpc
